flowchart TB
    subgraph ACQUIRE[1. 擷取]
        direction LR
        CONFIG[已設定的機構範圍]
        CATALOGUE[以機構為範圍的活動目錄]
        UPCOMING[即將舉行活動資料流]
        PAST[過往活動資料流]
        PAGINATION[並行且受限的分頁擷取<br/>每頁最多 50 筆記錄<br/>每個資料流最多 20 頁]
    end

    subgraph TRUST[2. 信任邊界]
        direction LR
        LIMITS[八秒逾時限制<br/>兩 MiB 回應大小限制]
        SCHEMA[執行階段結構描述與分頁驗證]
        PUBLIC_CONTRACT[僅接納公開活動合約]
    end

    subgraph NORMALISE[3. 經私隱篩選的正規化]
        direction LR
        FILTER[移除供應者專用及不支援的欄位]
        HKT[明確轉換為 HKT +08:00 時間]
        LINKS[產生標準 HTTPS 報名連結]
        DEDUP[依活動識別碼去除重複項目]
        SORT[以確定性規則排序]
        CACHE[五分鐘正規化快取]
    end

    subgraph DERIVE[4. 衍生與呈現]
        direction LR
        PHASE[準確的時間階段]
        CALENDAR[活動所涵蓋的香港曆日分類]
        CATEGORIES[確定性的已確認活動分類]
        DISPLAY[顯示次序、篩選器與行動按鈕]
        UI[首頁與節目介面]
    end

    FALLBACK{供應者請求失敗}
    WARM{是否存在有效的暖實例快照}
    COLD[如實顯示無法使用狀態]
    BOOKING[標準 The Ground 報名交接]

    CONFIG --> CATALOGUE
    CATALOGUE --> UPCOMING
    CATALOGUE --> PAST
    UPCOMING --> PAGINATION
    PAST --> PAGINATION
    PAGINATION --> LIMITS
    LIMITS --> SCHEMA
    SCHEMA --> PUBLIC_CONTRACT
    PUBLIC_CONTRACT --> FILTER
    FILTER --> HKT
    HKT --> LINKS
    LINKS --> DEDUP
    DEDUP --> SORT
    SORT --> CACHE

    CACHE --> PHASE
    CACHE --> CALENDAR
    CACHE --> CATEGORIES
    PHASE --> DISPLAY
    CALENDAR --> DISPLAY
    CATEGORIES --> DISPLAY
    DISPLAY --> UI
    UI --> BOOKING

    PAGINATION -.->|網絡、結構描述或限制錯誤| FALLBACK
    FALLBACK --> WARM
    WARM -->|是，使用最後一份有效快照| CACHE
    WARM -.->|沒有快照| COLD
    COLD -.->|The Ground 直接連結| BOOKING

    classDef acquire fill:#e4f1f7,stroke:#356a7d,color:#16333d
    classDef trust fill:#f7eadf,stroke:#8a5834,color:#442a18
    classDef normalise fill:#f0eef5,stroke:#675b79,color:#312a3a
    classDef derive fill:#eaf4e1,stroke:#48633c,color:#20301b
    classDef failure fill:#f9e4e4,stroke:#8b4545,color:#421f1f
    class CONFIG,CATALOGUE,UPCOMING,PAST,PAGINATION acquire
    class LIMITS,SCHEMA,PUBLIC_CONTRACT trust
    class FILTER,HKT,LINKS,DEDUP,SORT,CACHE normalise
    class PHASE,CALENDAR,CATEGORIES,DISPLAY,UI,BOOKING derive
    class FALLBACK,WARM,COLD failure
